ion":"Yugabyte SQL (YSQL)"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"frozenspider","id":2077017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzcwMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2077017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider","html_url":"https://github.com/frozenspider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"frozenspider","id":2077017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzcwMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2077017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider","html_url":"https://github.com/frozenspider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"nspiegelberg","id":53198280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTk4Mjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53198280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nspiegelberg","html_url":"https://github.com/nspiegelberg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nspiegelberg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nspiegelberg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nspiegelberg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nspiegelberg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nspiegelberg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nspiegelberg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nspiegelberg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nspiegelberg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nspiegelberg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2020-12-08T19:35:00Z","updated_at":"2021-01-25T10:01:14Z","closed_at":"2021-01-25T10:01:13Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Consider this simple example:\r\n```sql\r\nCREATE TABLE x (id int PRIMARY KEY);\r\nALTER TABLE x RENAME TO y;\r\nDROP TABLE y;\r\n\r\n-- This operation fails:\r\nCREATE TABLE y (id int PRIMARY KEY);\r\n-- ERROR:  Invalid argument: Invalid table definition: Timed out waiting for Table Creation\r\n```\r\n\r\nThanks @nspiegelberg for tracking this, it happens because rename uses names map that is intended for YCQL only.\r\nName is freed by restarting `yb-master`.\r\nHe proposed this patch, which seem to do the trick:\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/src/yb/master/catalog_manager.cc b/src/yb/master/catalog_manager.cc\r\nindex 54b9d49cd..32a06f6d4 100644\r\n--- a/src/yb/master/catalog_manager.cc\r\n+++ b/src/yb/master/catalog_manager.cc\r\n@@ -4085,7 +4085,9 @@ Status CatalogManager::AlterTable(const AlterTableRequestPB* req,\r\n     }\r\n \r\n     // Acquire the new table name (now we have 2 name for the same table).\r\n-    table_names_map_[{new_namespace_id, new_table_name}] = table;\r\n+    if (l->data().table_type() != PGSQL_TABLE_TYPE) {\r\n+      table_names_map_[{new_namespace_id, new_table_name}] = table;\r\n+    }\r\n     table_pb.set_namespace_id(new_namespace_id);\r\n     table_pb.set_name(new_table_name);\r\n \r\n@@ -4177,10 +4179,7 @@ Status CatalogManager::AlterTable(const AlterTableRequestPB* req,\r\n     TRACE(\"Removing (namespace, table) combination ($0, $1) from by-name map\",\r\n         namespace_id, table_name);\r\n     std::lock_guard<LockType> l_map(lock_);\r\n-    if (table->GetTableType() != PGSQL_TABLE_TYPE &&\r\n-        table_names_map_.erase({namespace_id, table_name}) != 1) {\r\n-      PANIC_RPC(rpc, \"Could not remove table from map, name=\" + l->data().name());\r\n-    }\r\n+    table_names_map_.erase({namespace_id, table_name}); // Not present if PGSQL.\r\n   }\r\n \r\n   // Update the in-memory state.\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"frozenspider","id":2077017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzcwMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2077017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider","html_url":"https://github.com/frozenspider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6585/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6585/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}